---
title: "Machine Shop Practices II"
code: "MAC-162"
category: "machine-technology"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Introduces safety procedures, bench work, hand tools, precision measuring instruments, drill presses, cut-off saws, engine lathes, manual surface grinders, and milling machines. Part II of II. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 3 hours. Total 5 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
